; DNS for AI Discovery (DNS-AID) — publish at your DNS provider for brunoholanda.com
; Spec: https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/draft-mozleywilliams-dnsop-dnsaid/
; Scanner looks for _index._agents / _a2a._agents / _mcp._agents SVCB/HTTPS records.
;
; IMPORTANT: These records cannot be shipped in the React build. Add them in the
; DNS panel of your registrar (Registro.br, Cloudflare, GoDaddy, Hostinger, etc.).
; Prefer enabling DNSSEC on the zone so validating resolvers accept the data.
;
; Replace TARGET hostnames/IPs with your real edge if different from www.

; --- Index entrypoint (well-known discovery) ---
_index._agents.brunoholanda.com.  3600  IN  HTTPS  1  www.brunoholanda.com. (
    alpn="h2,h3"
    port=443
)

; Optional SVCB twin for clients that query SVCB instead of HTTPS
_index._agents.brunoholanda.com.  3600  IN  SVCB  1  www.brunoholanda.com. (
    alpn="h2,h3"
    port=443
)

; --- MCP discovery leaf ---
_mcp._agents.brunoholanda.com.  3600  IN  HTTPS  1  www.brunoholanda.com. (
    alpn="h2,h3"
    port=443
)

; --- A2A-style leaf (points agents at the same HTTPS site / agent docs) ---
_a2a._agents.brunoholanda.com.  3600  IN  HTTPS  1  www.brunoholanda.com. (
    alpn="h2,h3"
    port=443
)

; Optional TXT capability hints (same owner names)
_index._agents.brunoholanda.com.  3600  IN  TXT  "agent-skills=/.well-known/agent-skills/index.json" "mcp=/.well-known/mcp/server-card.json" "llms=/llms.txt"

; After publishing, verify with DoH, e.g.:
; https://cloudflare-dns.com/dns-query?name=_index._agents.brunoholanda.com&type=HTTPS
; Then re-scan: POST https://isitagentready.com/api/scan {"url":"https://www.brunoholanda.com"}
